13
01:19:37,500 --> 01:19:43,500
Salsa is a 1988 romance film directed by Boaz Davidson and starring Robby
Rosa, Rodney Harvey, Angela Alvarado and Miranda Garrison.

14
01:25:45,000 --> 01:25:51,000
The film, about Puerto Rican dancer Rico who decides to enter a salsa dancing contest, earned a nomination
for the Golden Raspberry Award for Worst New Star for Rosa at the 9th Golden Raspberry Awards.

